"""
One default caliper (K = 49e-5 N m/Pa, p0 = 0.5e5 Pa, V0 = 0.5e-6 m³, K1 = 1e12 Pa/m³,
K3 = 4.8e23 Pa/m⁹, all gauge, p_amb = 100325 Pa) filled from a constant absolute pressure through
a default `Line` (3 mm bore, 1.5 m). It brakes a J = 100 kg m² shaft spinning at 100 rad/s, its
housing fixed. The source pressure is set per case: ambient plus the gauge pressure the case
applies.

Once the caliper has filled, no fluid flows and it sits at the line pressure: its gauge pressure p
is the source's less 100325 Pa. The line's resistance, 128 mu L/(pi D⁴ rho) (see the `Line` rig),
and the caliper's compliance rho dV/dp fill it with a time constant of 128 mu L V0/(pi D⁴ p0) =
128 · 0.01045 · 1.5 · 0.5e-6/(pi · 8.1e-11 · 0.5e5) = 0.0788 s below p0, and faster above it.
The caliper decelerates the shaft by at most 4875.5/100 = 48.8 rad/s², so in 2 s it keeps turning
above 100 - 97.5 = 2.5 rad/s, well above w0, and the full torque acts.

- `ambient`, 100325 Pa, a released circuit: p = 0 from the start, so no fluid flows, V stays 0
  and the caliper applies no torque.
- `clearance`, 125325 Pa, 0.25 bar above ambient and below p0: the pads have not reached the
  disc. V = V0 p/p0 = 0.5e-6 · 0.5 = 0.25e-6 m³ and the torque is 0. The fill stays below p0, so
  it is the one exponential of 0.0788 s: by 1 s it is within e^-12.69 = 3.1e-6 of its end,
  0.077 Pa and 7.7e-13 m³.
- `applied`, 10100325 Pa, 100 bar above ambient: the pads press the disc,
  p - p0 = K1 u + K3 u³ = 9.95e6 Pa. Bisection on [0, 1e-4] gives u = 2.49499e-6 m³
  (K1 u = 2.49499e6 Pa, K3 u³ = 7.45501e6 Pa), so V = 2.99499e-6 m³. The friction torque is
  K (p - p0) = 49e-5 · 9.95e6 = 4875.5 N m with the sign of w, positive. By 2 s the fill is
  complete to within e^-25.
"""
test component Caliper
  "Absolute line pressure, overridden per case"
  pressure = BlockComponents.Sources.Constant(k = 10100325.0) {
    "Dyad": {"placement": {"diagram": {"x1": 200, "x2": 300, "y1": 200, "y2": 300}}}
  }
  supply = HydraulicComponents.Sources.BoundaryPressure() {
    "Dyad": {"placement": {"diagram": {"x1": 450, "x2": 550, "y1": 200, "y2": 300}}}
  }
  line = VehicleComponents.Chassis.Brakes.Line() {
    "Dyad": {"placement": {"diagram": {"x1": 700, "x2": 800, "y1": 200, "y2": 300}}}
  }
  caliper = VehicleComponents.Chassis.Brakes.Caliper() {
    "Dyad": {"placement": {"diagram": {"x1": 1050, "x2": 950, "y1": 200, "y2": 300}}}
  }
  disc = RotationalComponents.Components.Inertia(J = 100.0, phi = initial 0.0, w = initial 100.0) {
    "Dyad": {
      "placement": {"diagram": {"x1": 1200, "x2": 1300, "y1": 200, "y2": 300, "rot": 180}}
    }
  }
  housing = RotationalComponents.Components.Fixed() {
    "Dyad": {"placement": {"diagram": {"x1": 950, "x2": 1050, "y1": 450, "y2": 550}}}
  }
  "DOT 4 brake fluid"
  path medium::HydraulicComponents.Interfaces.AbstractMedium = VehicleComponents.DOT4
relations
  connect(pressure.y, supply.p) {"Dyad": {"edges": [{"S": 1, "M": [], "E": 2}], "path": {}}}
  connect(supply.port, line.port_a) {"Dyad": {"edges": [{"S": 1, "M": [], "E": 2}], "path": {}}}
  connect(line.port_b, caliper.port) {
    "Dyad": {
      "edges": [
        {
          "S": 1,
          "M": [{"x": 900, "y": 250}, {"x": 900, "y": 150}, {"x": 1000, "y": 150}],
          "E": 2
        }
      ],
      "path": {}
    }
  }
  continuity(medium, supply.port.medium)
  connect(disc.spline_b, caliper.spline_a) {"Dyad": {"edges": [{"S": 1, "M": [], "E": 2}], "path": {}}}
  connect(caliper.support, housing.spline) {"Dyad": {"edges": [{"S": 1, "M": [], "E": 2}], "path": {}}}
metadata {
  "Dyad": {
    "tests": {
      "ambient": {
        "stop": 1,
        "solver": "Auto",
        "abstol": 1e-10,
        "reltol": 1e-8,
        "params": {"pressure.k": 100325.0},
        "atol": {"caliper.V": 1e-12, "caliper.tau": 1e-6, "caliper.tau_friction": 1e-6},
        "expect": {"final": {"caliper.V": 0.0, "caliper.tau": 0.0, "caliper.tau_friction": 0.0}}
      },
      "clearance": {
        "stop": 1,
        "solver": "Auto",
        "abstol": 1e-10,
        "reltol": 1e-8,
        "params": {"pressure.k": 125325.0},
        "atol": {"caliper.p": 0.1, "caliper.V": 1e-12, "caliper.tau": 1e-6},
        "expect": {
          "initial": {"caliper.V": 0.0},
          "final": {"caliper.p": 2.5e4, "caliper.V": 0.25e-6, "caliper.tau": 0.0}
        }
      },
      "applied": {
        "stop": 2,
        "solver": "Auto",
        "abstol": 1e-10,
        "reltol": 1e-8,
        "atol": {"caliper.p": 1.0, "caliper.V": 1e-11, "caliper.tau_friction": 0.001},
        "expect": {
          "final": {"caliper.p": 1.0e7, "caliper.V": 2.99499e-6, "caliper.tau_friction": 4875.5}
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
end
